                                "sense_id": "ebb04a85-b8bc-3603-ab9a-2188e666d68f",
                                "text": "Bothered by the conviction of making no impression on her, he pulled up at a strip of road shaded by tall spotted gums, blackbutt, and honeysuckle, and produced a packet of cigarettes. \"About time for a smoke-O,\" he said, \"Have a fag, Cora.'"
                            },
